{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——不说别的，\\n濑名同学对待班委的工作总是能做到快刀斩乱麻。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "——不说别的，濑名同学对待班委的工作总是能做到快刀斩乱麻。", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，过来一下」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0282", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯。怎么了？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「班委的工作。\\n　要去和烹饪实习的老师商议分组的事情」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": "「班委的工作。　要去和烹饪实习的老师商议分组的事情」", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0283", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她今天也是一如既往地不断找我搭话。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生！该去办公室了。\\n　下节课要用的资料不够分给各务台学院的学生」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "「瓜生！该去办公室了。　下节课要用的资料不够分给各务台学院的学生」", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0284", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，知道了」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等办完那个，顺便从八冢老师那里\\n　把咱们班的考试范围说明的打印件\\n　也一起拿过来吧」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "「等办完那个，顺便从八冢老师那里　把咱们班的考试范围说明的打印件　也一起拿过来吧」", "plain_idx": 282, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0285", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道了，那个就让我来搬吧……」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她不断地找我搭话，\\n以惊人的速度和高效的技巧，\\n接连不断地完成工作。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "她不断地找我搭话，以惊人的速度和高效的技巧，接连不断地完成工作。", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——她为什么每次都如此积极主动呢？", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "——她为什么每次都如此积极主动呢？", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不太懂，但我作为搭档，\\n也只能紧随其后了。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "不太懂，但我作为搭档，也只能紧随其后了。", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
