{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来了来了……」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也只能紧随其后啊……", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎、怎么样？做得好吃吗，瓜生？」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0023", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……嗯，好吃！嗯，这个真的很好吃……」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀～太好了，安洁！」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "jc0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是太好了。\\n　安洁的帮忙也是值得的♪」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「真是太好了。　安洁的帮忙也是值得的♪」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0209", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我们已经上过了各种各样的特别课程，\\n但可能因为我们的第一节特别课程就是烹饪，\\n我还是感觉烹饪实习是最轻松的一门课。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "虽然我们已经上过了各种各样的特别课程，但可能因为我们的第一节特别课程就是烹饪，我还是感觉烹饪实习是最轻松的一门课。", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 61, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班里的女生们也是，\\n愿意让我品尝菜肴味道的人越来越多了。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "班里的女生们也是，愿意让我品尝菜肴味道的人越来越多了。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「气氛这么热闹，真是不好意思，\\n　瓜生过来一下」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "「气氛这么热闹，真是不好意思，　瓜生过来一下」", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0287", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，爱理同学」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0210", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
