{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当习惯了这种奢华后，\\n午餐在学校食堂吃也还挺不错的。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "当习惯了这种奢华后，午餐在学校食堂吃也还挺不错的。", "plain_idx": 323, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
