{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以经常发生“我在人群之中\\n被濑名同学找了出去”这种事。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "所以经常发生“我在人群之中被濑名同学找了出去”这种事。", "plain_idx": 376, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我是那种会在各个方向上都在意的人，\\n所以中途离开还是会让我感到有些别扭。不过——", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "我是那种会在各个方向上都在意的人，所以中途离开还是会让我感到有些别扭。不过——", "plain_idx": 378, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更让我在意的是……在大家看来，\\n似乎是濑名同学胡乱地把我叫了出去……", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "更让我在意的是……在大家看来，似乎是濑名同学胡乱地把我叫了出去……", "plain_idx": 380, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那走吧」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0293", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这女孩可能没意识到吧。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0294", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，濑名同学的笔速依然很快。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打扰啦～……爱理同学、新吾同学\\n　不添麻烦的话要不要喝点茶呢～……」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": "「打扰啦～……爱理同学、新吾同学　不添麻烦的话要不要喝点茶呢～……」", "plain_idx": 388, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0212", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢，不过我现在不需要」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0295", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "回答安洁的时候，她也没有抬起脸来。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先把活干好再说，以认真过头的态度，\\n将全身心都投入到工作中。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "先把活干好再说，以认真过头的态度，将全身心都投入到工作中。", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到这样的濑名同学，我也不能松懈。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，既然决定紧随其后了，\\n那就得全力以赴。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": "总之，既然决定紧随其后了，那就得全力以赴。", "plain_idx": 397, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也不需要。抱歉啊，安洁，谢谢你特意过来」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事没事没事。如果安洁也是班委，\\n　那就可以帮上忙了，真是抱歉」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": "「没事没事没事。如果安洁也是班委，　那就可以帮上忙了，真是抱歉」", "plain_idx": 400, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0213", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果有什么需要帮忙的，请随时告诉我」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0214", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没关系，很快就干完了……」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0296", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，干完了」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0297", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，辛苦了！」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0215", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好嘞，我也干完了」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？！」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0298", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我拼命投入工作的回报，\\n就是我们首次成功地同时完成了任务。", "text_idx": 413, "plain": "我拼命投入工作的回报，就是我们首次成功地同时完成了任务。", "plain_idx": 414, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抬起头，彼此目光相交。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0299", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学处在正要从椅子上起身的姿势，\\n露出了尴尬的表情。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "濑名同学处在正要从椅子上起身的姿势，露出了尴尬的表情。", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么看，她这都是错过了以往说“我先走了”这句话的时机。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……也许同时完成并不是个好事啊。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，好了，\\n　就让安洁为你们泡杯茶吧～？」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": "「好了，好了，　就让安洁为你们泡杯茶吧～？」", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0216", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，不用——」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": "「啊，不用——」", "plain_idx": 424, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，爱理」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0264", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在我试图阻止安洁的时候，\\n樱乃打开门走了进来。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": "就在我试图阻止安洁的时候，樱乃打开门走了进来。", "plain_idx": 428, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「白天看你感觉完成了很多工作，\\n　所以我想今天或许可以一起回家」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": "「白天看你感觉完成了很多工作，　所以我想今天或许可以一起回家」", "plain_idx": 430, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0265", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这是……好时机还是坏时机呢……", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃迈着小碎步走向了濑名同学。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「做完了？」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0266", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……刚、刚完」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0300", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学显得越来越尴尬。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理——！\\n　感激吧，美羽学姐过来邀请你了」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": "「爱理——！　感激吧，美羽学姐过来邀请你了」", "plain_idx": 440, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0060", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，小爱～\\n　工作完我们一起回家……吧，咦？」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": "「瓜生，小爱～　工作完我们一起回家……吧，咦？」", "plain_idx": 443, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0117", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "随后，连天羽学姐和乾同学也过来了。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看来正好呢。\\n　一起回家吧？瓜生，小爱」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": "「看来正好呢。　一起回家吧？瓜生，小爱」", "plain_idx": 447, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0118", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，嗯，我倒是没问题……」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说完，我看了看旁边的濑名同学。", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都能一起回家，可真好啊。\\n但我果然还是有点碍眼吧……", "text_idx": 451, "plain": "大家都能一起回家，可真好啊。但我果然还是有点碍眼吧……", "plain_idx": 452, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学不是有急事么……」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……今天不行吗？爱理」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0267", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃……」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0301", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃微微歪着头问道，让濑名同学一时语塞。", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论是天羽学姐还是樱乃，都让濑名同学难以招架，\\n嗯，这种招数是我用不出的，不愧是她俩……", "text_idx": 459, "plain": "无论是天羽学姐还是樱乃，都让濑名同学难以招架，嗯，这种招数是我用不出的，不愧是她俩……", "plain_idx": 460, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是濑名同学……", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……今天没事」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0302", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咦？！是、是吗？」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天还好……」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0303", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样啊，她平常都是急着回去，今天显得格外急，\\n我还以为她放学后有什么要忙的事……", "text_idx": 467, "plain": "这样啊，她平常都是急着回去，今天显得格外急，我还以为她放学后有什么要忙的事……", "plain_idx": 468, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来并不是每天都很急啊。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「不如说是明天啊……」", "text_idx": 470, "plain": "「むしろ明日よ……」", "plain_idx": 471, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0304", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么也没有。\\n　那今天就一起回家吧」", "text_idx": 474, "plain": "「什么也没有。　那今天就一起回家吧」", "plain_idx": 475, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0305", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔——」", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0268", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，既然安洁没能沏上茶，\\n　就让我完美地为大家送行吧！」", "text_idx": 479, "plain": "「那么，既然安洁没能沏上茶，　就让我完美地为大家送行吧！」", "plain_idx": 480, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0217", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0306", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个，她看起来非常不情愿，这样真的可以吗？", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「路上小心，路上小心～♪」", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0218", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么大家，明天见咯」", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0119", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，今天去美羽学姐家里玩，\\n　你们一定很羡慕吧，但是只有我一个人能去～」", "text_idx": 488, "plain": "「呵呵呵，今天去美羽学姐家里玩，　你们一定很羡慕吧，但是只有我一个人能去～」", "plain_idx": 489, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0061", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明是来邀请我的，结果自己先走了……\\n　算了，再怎么抱怨也没用……」", "text_idx": 491, "plain": "「明明是来邀请我的，结果自己先走了……　算了，再怎么抱怨也没用……」", "plain_idx": 492, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0307", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起走出了校门，但由于离家距离不同，\\n今天的归家队伍也很快就减少了人数。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": "大家一起走出了校门，但由于离家距离不同，今天的归家队伍也很快就减少了人数。", "plain_idx": 495, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「让你陪着我们真是抱歉啊，濑名同学」", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你没有必要道歉。\\n　邀请我的是学姐和樱乃」", "text_idx": 497, "plain": "「你没有必要道歉。　邀请我的是学姐和樱乃」", "plain_idx": 498, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0308", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，就用聊天来弥补吧」", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0269", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被使命感驱使着，樱乃点了点头，\\n然后走到了濑名同学的身边。", "text_idx": 502, "plain": "被使命感驱使着，樱乃点了点头，然后走到了濑名同学的身边。", "plain_idx": 503, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我们也快要和濑名同学分别了吧。", "text_idx": 504, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，你平时都在哪买东西？」", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0270", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？啊嗯……随便吧」", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0309", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊」", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0271", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我平时都是在家附近的超市买的。\\n　而且这个惠民超市明天是特价日呢」", "text_idx": 511, "plain": "「我平时都是在家附近的超市买的。　而且这个惠民超市明天是特价日呢」", "plain_idx": 512, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0272", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃……！！」", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0310", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这时，濑名同学突然僵住了。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0273", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？」", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没什么！」", "text_idx": 520, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0311", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不，她这看起来并不像是“没什么”的样子……", "text_idx": 522, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但在这种情况下，自然也不太合适追问。", "text_idx": 523, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对不住对不住，是我失礼了。\\n　樱乃接着讲吧」", "text_idx": 524, "plain": "「对不住对不住，是我失礼了。　樱乃接着讲吧」", "plain_idx": 525, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……从蔬菜到日用品，价格低得都让人开心。\\n　可以的话，我想推荐给爱理」", "text_idx": 526, "plain": "「……从蔬菜到日用品，价格低得都让人开心。　可以的话，我想推荐给爱理」", "plain_idx": 527, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0274", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，樱乃，冷静想一下，\\n　像濑名同学这样的大小姐应该不会去我们常去的那种超市吧？」", "text_idx": 529, "plain": "「不是，樱乃，冷静想一下，　像濑名同学这样的大小姐应该不会去我们常去的那种超市吧？」", "plain_idx": 530, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说来也是。\\n　毕竟爱理还可以去各务台商场呢」", "text_idx": 531, "plain": "「说来也是。　毕竟爱理还可以去各务台商场呢」", "plain_idx": 532, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0275", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是呢……」", "text_idx": 534, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0312", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，我们初次见面的时候，\\n　也是我去各务台商场的时候」", "text_idx": 536, "plain": "「说起来，我们初次见面的时候，　也是我去各务台商场的时候」", "plain_idx": 537, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0276", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0313", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么……今天辛苦了」", "text_idx": 540, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0314", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "分道扬镳后濑名同学走向回家的路——\\n她姿势前倾，步子迈得比往常都大。", "text_idx": 542, "plain": "分道扬镳后濑名同学走向回家的路——她姿势前倾，步子迈得比往常都大。", "plain_idx": 543, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……爱理果然是有急事啊」", "text_idx": 544, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0277", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们做坏事了」", "text_idx": 546, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0278", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～不过……」", "text_idx": 548, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真有急事的话，就不会陪我们了，\\n　所以放心吧，我觉得没事的，樱乃」", "text_idx": 549, "plain": "「真有急事的话，就不会陪我们了，　所以放心吧，我觉得没事的，樱乃」", "plain_idx": 550, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「稍微安心了」", "text_idx": 551, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0279", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥是能让我稍微安心的专家」", "text_idx": 553, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0280", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我这技能对于濑名同学都不起作用啊\\n……我把这句话咽了下去。", "text_idx": 555, "plain": "不过，我这技能对于濑名同学都不起作用啊……我把这句话咽了下去。", "plain_idx": 556, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
